<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Activer 2FA - Naja7ni</title>

    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/png" href="{{ asset('assets/images/about/favicon.png') }}">

    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

    <!-- Custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/main.css') }}">
</head>

<body class="bg-background text-foreground font-sans">
    <div class="flex h-screen overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        {% include 'front/partials/_sidebar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Top Navbar -->
            {% include 'front/partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

            <!-- Content Area -->
            <div id="content" class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto bg-muted/30">
                <div class="p-8 min-h-full">
                    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-8">
                        <!-- Header -->
                        <div class="mb-8">
                            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Activer l'authentification à deux facteurs</h1>
                            <p class="text-muted-foreground">Sécurisez votre compte avec Google Authenticator</p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Flash Messages -->
                        {% for message in app.flashes('success') %}
                            <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 text-green-800 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span>{{ message }}</span>
                                <button type="button" class="text-green-500 hover:text-green-700" onclick="this.parentElement.style.display='none';">
                                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        {% endfor %}

                        <!-- QR Code Card -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-border p-8">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
                                <div class="flex-1">
                                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
                                            <i data-lucide="qr-code" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        Étape 1 : Scannez le code QR
                                    </h2>
                                    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">
                                        Ouvrez l'application Google Authenticator et scannez ce code QR, ou entrez manuellement le code ci-dessous.
                                    </p>
                                    
                                    <div class="space-y-4">
                                        <!-- QR Code -->
                                        <div class="flex justify-center p-6 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg">
                                            <img src="{{ qrCodeDataUri }}" alt="Code QR" class="w-64 h-64">
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Manual Code -->
                                        <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg">
                                            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-900 mb-2">Code d'entrée manuelle :</p>
                                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                                <code class="flex-1 text-lg font-mono bg-white p-3 rounded border border-blue-200">{{ secret }}</code>
                                                <button type="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('{{ secret }}'); alert('Code copié!');" class="p-2 hover:bg-blue-100 rounded transition-colors">
                                                    <i data-lucide="copy" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600"></i>
                                                </button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Instructions Card -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-border p-8">
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
                                    <i data-lucide="book-open" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"></i>
                                </div>
                                Étape 2 : Instructions de configuration
                            </h2>
                            <ol class="space-y-3 list-decimal list-inside text-foreground">
                                <li class="text-base">Ouvrez l'application Google Authenticator sur votre téléphone</li>
                                <li class="text-base">Appuyez sur le bouton <span class="font-semibold">"+"</span> pour ajouter un nouveau compte</li>
                                <li class="text-base">Choisissez <span class="font-semibold">"Scanner un code QR"</span> ou entrez le code manuellement</li>
                                <li class="text-base">L'application générera un code à 6 chiffres</li>
                                <li class="text-base">À votre prochaine connexion, vous serez invité à entrer ce code</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Download Apps Card -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-border p-8">
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
                                    <i data-lucide="download" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"></i>
                                </div>
                                Télécharger Google Authenticator
                            </h2>
                            <div class="flex gap-4">
                                <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google.android.apps.authenticator2" target="_blank" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 p-4 border border-border rounded-lg hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                                    <i data-lucide="smartphone" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                    <span class="font-medium">Android</span>
                                </a>
                                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/google-authenticator/id388497605" target="_blank" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 p-4 border border-border rounded-lg hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors">
                                    <i data-lucide="smartphone" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                    <span class="font-medium">iOS</span>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Warning Card -->
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-6 rounded">
                            <div class="flex gap-4">
                                <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Important</h3>
                                    <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm">
                                        Gardez votre téléphone en sécurité ! Si vous perdez l'accès à Google Authenticator, vous ne pourrez plus vous connecter. Envisagez de sauvegarder vos codes de récupération.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Action Buttons -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <a href="{{ path('app_front_profile') }}" class="flex-1 bg-primary text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                Terminé - Retour au profil
                            </a>
                            <a href="{{ path('app_front_profile') }}" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-border hover:bg-muted/50 transition-all font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                Annuler
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Lucide Icons Script -->
    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
